      "source_review": {
        "basis": "Independently reopened and read DiMichele/Bateman2020 abstract and relevant sections3.3,4.1–4.3 with figure captions. They support opposite rows through trunk/crown, compact planar anisotomous systems and distal slender Flemingites cones. DiMichele1980 original PDF p1466–1467 confirms the historical synonym linkage; Seward1910 fig186A/B and adjacent text were personally read/viewed as vascular anatomy only. PanelC is another taxon and excluded.",
