        ],
        "limits": "2020 figure pixels were not viewed and are not asserted available. Historical anatomy does not prove crown/root form. Counts, overall size, color and short basal rhizomorph cues remain interpretations. The source discusses a possibly smaller concurrent number of fully expanded laterals; the frozen educational count is not asserted as a universal life-history fact. Original inventory Chinese spherical-cone phrase is retained as raw planning history, superseded by the evidence-based slender-cone frozen design."
